desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "golang"
	title: "Struct scan: Go md5.Sum/New"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Go md5.Sum/New"
	type: vuln
	level: medium
	rule_id: "struct-go-md5-sum"
	risk: "weak-hash"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 crypto/md5。MD5 不抗碰撞。

### 风险类型
weak-hash

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学原语，若处理外部数据或用于安全场景，可能导致命令执行、代码执行、反序列化或机密性破坏。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
改用 crypto/sha256。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://hash.go": <<<POS
package main
import "crypto/md5"
func digest(b []byte) [16]byte {
	return md5.Sum(b)
}

POS
	"safefile://hash-safe.go": <<<NEG
package main
import "crypto/sha256"
func digest(b []byte) [32]byte {
	return sha256.Sum256(b)
}

NEG
)

md5.Sum as $call
md5.Sum(* as $data) as $call
md5.New as $call
md5.New() as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "medium",
	title: "Go md5",
	title_zh: "Go md5",
	message: "结构扫描：Go md5.Sum/New",
	risk: "weak-hash",
}
